{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000909","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000909"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000909","label":"公孫臣","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"公孫臣","mention_ids":["c-shiji-010-wendi:m029-0018","c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0016"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m029-0018","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p029","quote":"公孫臣"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0016","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p030","quote":"公孫臣"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m029-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"公孫臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000909","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"公孫臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000909","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p030","chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p029","text":"是時北平侯張蒼為丞相，方明律歷。魯人公孫臣上書陳終始傳五德事，言方今土德時，土德應黃龍見，當改正朔服色制度。天子下其事與丞相議。丞相推以為今水德，始明正十月上黑事，以為其言非是，請罷之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m029-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張蒼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000885","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m029-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"公孫臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000909","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m029-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:p030","text":"十五年，黃龍見成紀，天子乃復召魯公孫臣，以為博士，申明土德事。於是上乃下詔曰：「有異物之神見于成紀，無害於民，歲以有年。朕親郊祀上帝諸神。禮官議，毋諱以勞朕。」有司禮官皆曰：「古者天子夏躬親禮祀上帝於郊，故曰郊。」於是天子始幸雍，郊見五帝，以孟夏四月答禮焉。趙人新垣平以望氣見，因說上設立渭陽五廟。欲出周鼎，當有玉英見。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0016","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"公孫臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000909","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"諸神","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0090","start":90,"end":92,"surface":"天子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"古者天子泛稱，不指本朝文帝。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000806","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"五帝","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、群體或神祇指稱未定；不補未見姓名或血親。"},{"id":"c-shiji-010-wendi:m030-0131","start":131,"end":134,"surface":"新垣平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000910","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","book_id":"b-shiji-010","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-010-wendi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-010","source_id":"s-shiji-010-wendi","source":{"title":"史記／卷010","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷010","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷010&oldid=2599229","rev